sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Flush goroutine
    participant B as Blocked store
    participant A as activeQ
    participant W as Scheduler worker

    Note over F,W: Controlled legal interleaving<br/>Production frequency is not measured
    F->>B: Build eligible admission order<br/>(expiry heap or collected map slice)
    F->>A: Push first item low and Signal

    alt Worker reacquires the activeQ lock first
        W->>A: Pop low<br/>(high is not resident yet)
        F->>A: Push next eligible high
        Note over F,W: A second Pop cannot begin before this flush releases its outer lock
    else Flusher admits the full eligible batch first
        F->>A: Push next eligible high
        W->>A: Pop high<br/>(priority compares both residents)
    end

    Note over F,A: Equal backoff completion already selects high first
